Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:01.55,Narr,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Viernes por la tarde.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.62,0:00:04.45,Narr,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Pedro acaba la semana\Ny quiere desconectar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.45,0:00:06.75,Narr,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}pero no tiene\Nningún plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.05,0:00:11.95,Pedro,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}¿Pintxo de tortilla y bebida\Npor 3,50 €?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.95,0:00:13.85,Pedro,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}¡Eso sí que es un plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.05,0:00:18.50,Narr,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Ahora Pedro\Nya tiene plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.45,0:00:22.80,Pedro,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}¡Salud!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:26.15,Narr,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}No te pierdas el mejor\Nplan del día.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.15,0:00:28.66,Narr,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Entra en\Nescaparatetudela.es
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.66,0:00:30.12,Narr,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}y que no te lo cuenten.
